# "If you control three or more artifacts": Bot2's three Moxen do not count for Bot1, so with Mox Opal and Mox Ruby it is still
# refused. An Ornithopter, an artifact creature, is the third artifact (the positive control): the Opal then adds green.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Opal
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Opal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
! Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Opal.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Opal.Activate(Color: Green)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {G}
